Ask for a guest runtime build.

This file has no content. Touch it - or make any commit whose message contains
"guest build" - and the iOS workflow builds the emulator and the guest image and
ships an IPA with them inside.

    touch ios/GUEST-BUILD
    git commit -m "guest build please" ios/GUEST-BUILD

It exists because GitHub's scheduler has not fired a single scheduled run on this
fork, and there is no other way for a change to reach the runner. Once a scheduled
run has worked, the schedule is the way and this file's comment can say so.
